 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** $O(S)$ per ray, where $S$ is the number of samples. Lighting calculations (dot products, power, vector normalization) add a constant overhead per sample compared to standard compositing [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(1)$ per ray for accumulators and temporary vectors [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Measured Performance:** Not given in the sources.
